Subject: [PATCH] Add authenticated native V2 Avalanche quorum and typed
 polling engine

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Add an authenticated native Avalanche quorum and typed polling engine using pinned upstream proof and vote primitives. Standalone tests exercise local quorum, inventory and polling behavior; the engine does not implement peer wire transport.

